Website

https://www.w3schools.com/html/html_tables.asp

📝 Steps to remember
1. Create Project
Open UiPath Studio
New → Process
Give name: WebpageToExcel
2. Open Webpage

Add:

Use Application/Browser

Enter the website URL.

https://www.w3schools.com/html/html_tables.asp
3. Extract Table

Inside Use Application/Browser → Do:

Add:

Extract Table Data

Select the table from webpage.

Create output variable:

dtTable
Type:
DataTable

👉 This stores the webpage table.

4. Create Excel

Below the browser activity, add:

Use Excel File

Create/select:

WebData.xlsx
5. Write to Excel

Inside Use Excel File, add:

Write DataTable to Excel

Set:

What to write → dtTable
Destination → "Sheet1!A1"
6. Run

Click:

Save → Run ▶️

The webpage table will be extracted and stored in Excel.
